——對哦，昆侖隊員不也是那邊的出身嗎！記得當時她向我提到店主時表情還有些奇怪……對對，這行先空著，等我向昆侖隊員打聽打聽她對瑞澤瞭解多少。]],["sBloodType"]="AB",["sEstimate"]="？？？",["sStature"]="70/62/88",["nStatureLv"]=30,["sHate"]="？？？",["sTechnique"]="？？？",["body"]="Dorm_Girl_m1_white_Body",["key"]=20160,["sInterview3Lv"]=50,["sPainter"]="???",["nBirthDayLv"]=10,["sRecord2"]="？？？",["nStoryLv"]=30,["sInterview2Lv"]=30,["nHateLv"]=30,["sPhysicalAbi"]="優",["sBirthDay"]="2/5",["tBody"]=2,["sHarmony"]="？？？",["sSounder_jp"]="???",["sInterview2"]="？？？",["tType"]=8,["sInterview1Lv"]=10,["tRace"]=1,["nBloodTypeLv"]=30,["nAbilityId"]={4001}
